    "updated_at": "2025-10-29T05:32:03Z",
    "body": "I'm sure you're right, I haven't worked closely with the JS spec. In that case, the change to specify the the value of the assignment is unnecessary, but I believe the point still stands that the playback position on the timeline is not guaranteed to be immediately observable by a script after seeking begins, with the parallel nature of the steps as they stand currently.\r\n\r\nI'm not able to update the PR at the moment, but when I'm back home I'll remove the first part of that change.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
