    "created_at": "2026-01-17T01:04:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-17T01:04:35Z",
    "body": "I've updated the first commit to fix another bug where the official playback position would revert to the last available position if the media element is paused in the middle of a seek. To do so, the pause steps now skip setting the official playback position if a seek is in progress.",
