    "body": "> @Zaggy1024 can you write tests in WPT for these cases where the implementations all agree with each other but don't match the spec?\r\n\r\nI think it's best that I hold off on making a PR for new test cases until it's decided whether #11773 and #11774 are valid, and how they should be solved. I'll definitely follow up on this when those are more concrete. \r\n\r\nI'll also need to update this PR to include a fix that aligns with Chromium's behavior on #4487 (superseding #11775), but I'd like to hold off on that until I can address any corrections to all three commits at once.",
